{"games":[{"id":14125634878,"name":"PROVE MOM WRONG + BE FAMOUS ! ⭐","desc":"📱 Record videos\n🎉 Grow your following\n⭐ Become famous!\n\nYou are a young and ambitious content creator who wants to make a living out of your online passion. You love creating videos online. However, your mom doesn’t get it. She thinks you are lazy, irresponsible, and delusional. She wants you to get a real job and start acting like an adult.\n\nIn this game, you grow your content creator career and prove your mom wrong by rebuying the house you guys owned.\n\n(Use the phone to record videos and after you will be able to publish the videos by using the computer pointed by the game guide, from there your videos will be in trending and are going to generate money which you can use to buy objects around the house)","path":"/game/14125634878-prove-mom-wrong-be-famous","slug":"14125634878-prove-mom-wrong-be-famous","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-63a2bfb7ede4b1df9c913b9d9cc8f592/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://scriptblox.com/images/no-script.webp","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":18,"visitor":26722717,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2023-12-13T11:30:45.008Z","creator":{"name":"Mac & Cheeese","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6911596531,"name":"Defend the Statue","desc":"Shutdowns correlate to bug fixes and update releases.\nEarn x1.5 XP during weekends!\n\nTimes we murdered Roblox Servers: 2.1\nTimes we went on vacation: 1\n\nDevelopment State: Beta\nWaves Complete: 35 / 50\nVersion: v0.9.0 (WIP)\nUpcoming: N/A","path":"/game/6911596531-defend-the-statue","slug":"6911596531-defend-the-statue","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-cb954ce92a3b1d7567c6f3841c6c1100/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/a83ce253de7d1922fe43e109fef9e443/150/150/Image/Jpeg","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":18,"visitor":2449502,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-02-19T22:50:39.612Z","creator":{"name":"Nostalgic Proctors","ty